$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f2> Capture the Flag\n<f1>Planet: <f2> Tyr's Cradle\n<f1>Weather: <f2> Snow and ice\n<f1>Time of Day: <f2> Night\n<f1>Number of Teams: <f2> 2\n\n<f1>Briefing:\n\n<f2>This was designed as a Defend and Destroy map. I converted it to CTF just for the hell of it. The D&D version of it also comes with the HaVoC mod.\n\n<f0>Both the <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> tribes have established bases on this frozen world and neither will back down. To claim this planet your tribe must capture the enemy flag 6 times.\n\nGood luck!\n\n<f1>Map by: <f2>[HvC]NaTeDoGG aka Nathan Sweet\nFor use only with the HaVoC mod.\nhttp://havoc.sirris.com";
$MDESC::Type = "CTF Mixed";
